    while (monitoring) {
        // Sleep to allow event processing
        Sleep(500);
    }

    // Cleanup
    UnhookKeyboard(hook);
    return 0;
}
```

**Step 5: Compile and Run**

Compile the code into an executable file (e.g., `keystroke_logger.exe`). Note that this requires the Windows SDK to be installed. The program will run in the background and log keystrokes to `KeystrokeLog.txt`.

