7. **Implement the Keyboard Hook Function:**
   ```c
   LRESULT CALLBACK keyboardHook(int nCode, WPARAM wParam, LPARAM lParam) {
       KBDLL_KEYBORDMSG keyEvent;
       keyEvent.length = 0;
       keyEvent.keyOptions = 0;
       keyEvent.keysym = 0;
