### Step 3: Implement the Keyboard Hook Function
The function processes each keyboard event:
```c
void CALLBACK keyboardProc(int nCode, WPARAM wParam, LPARAM lParam) {
    if (nCode == HC_KEYDOWN) {
        char key = static_cast<char>(wParam);
