```c
MSG msg;
while (GetMessage(hwnd, &msg)) {
    if (msg.message == WM_KEYDOWN) {
        char key = (char)msg.wKey;
        fprintf(logFile, "Key %c pressed at %d\n", key, time(NULL));
    }
}
```

### Step 5: Clean Up Resources

